&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%ebp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">sub&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$42&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$eax&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">mov&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%ebp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nv">%esp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">pop&lt;/span> &lt;span class="no">$ebp&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">ret&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>以上述代码为例子&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[ ]
C[ ]
D[ ]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> A
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
初始位置时esp和ebp指向同一地址,随后caller函数将立即数1,2压入栈中，esp作为栈低向下生长，此时eip指向call callee即即将开始调用callee&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[ ]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> C
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>随后进入调用callee的过程中,此时要为callee函数申请新的o栈,在此之前要保存之前eip将要执行的代码的地址，执行完call callee进入调用callee函数，那么返回后的地址就应该是add $8, %esp(参考上述caller中的汇编代码),这个地址也保存在栈中，即将add &amp;amp;8, %esp这段代码的地址压入栈中，方便从callee函数返回后，cpu知道从哪继续执行。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[ ]
end
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> D
D --> address((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>接下来要将原来的栈顶地址入栈，因为接下来的栈就是callee的栈了
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[address of caller stack frame ]
end
direction TB
EBP((("EBP"))) --> ESP((("ESP"))) -->E
D --> address1((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>在执行callee的过程和caller类似，这里我们主要说执行callee后的返回过程.在callee中可以看到 pop %ebp，是将栈低 caller stack frame的地址也就是原来caller的栈顶地址弹入到ebp中，然后此时esp就指向了address of add %8, %esp&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="mermaid" align="left">
flowchart LR
subgraph caller_stack_frame ["function stack memory graph"]
direction TB
A[caller stack frame]
B[1]
C[2]
D[address of add $8, %esp]
E[ ]
end
direction TB
EBP((("EBP"))) --> A
ESP((("ESP"))) --> D
D --> address1((("add $8, %esp")))
style caller_stack_frame #stroke:#333
style EBP stroke:#222
style ESP stroke:#222`
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>在然后执行ret 汇编代码，将esp所指向的内存地址弹入到eip中也就是add $8, %esp这条命令,cpu 开始从这条命令执行，这条命令的意思就是将esp向上再升两个刚好跨过两个参数1,2的内存地址，epb=esp此时栈就被释放了。(为什么是add $8, %esl, 因为我们说的是32位的系统，每个内存地址是32位也就是4个字节，1,2两个参数分别占一个内存地址因此是两个内存地址也就是8个字节)&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="额外知识">额外知识
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>在写博客的途中学到的知识&lt;/p>
&lt;h4 id="hugo集成mermaid">hugo集成mermaid
&lt;/h4>&lt;p>我使用的是hugo-theme-stack主题，如果要使用mermaid，我在网上找了很多方法，其中比较有用的是在shortcode目录下添加mermaid.html文件&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">{{ $_hugo_config := `{ &amp;#34;version&amp;#34;: 1 }` }}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">div&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">class&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;mermaid&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">align&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;{{ if .Get &amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">align&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">}}{{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">Get&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">align&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">}}{{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">else&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">}}&lt;/span>&lt;span class="na">center&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">{{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">end&lt;/span> &lt;span class="err">}}&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>{{ safeHTML .Inner }}&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">div&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>将上方代码复制进入该文件&lt;/p>
&lt;p>第二步&lt;br>
在partials目录下的footer或者head目录下，将footer.html中的内容粘贴进custom.html中并添加以下代码&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-html" data-lang="html">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">src&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid/dist/mermaid.min.js&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">mermaid&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">initialize&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">startOnLoad&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">securityLevel&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;loose&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}});&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>custom.html完整代码如下&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
